{
  "_comment": "Recommended Claude Code settings for this harness. Merge them into ~/.claude/settings.json with: python3 _bin/claude_settings.py merge (adds only what you do not have, asks first, keeps a backup). __VAULT__ becomes the vault path. Hooks are not here: guardian.py repair --hooks-only installs and repairs them.",
